{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>譚詠麟（校長）一連10場的《譚詠麟與您「刻骨銘心」世界巡迴演唱會—終極篇》昨晚（11日）在紅館正式開鑼，首場演出獲不少好友捧場，包括曾志偉、李克勤、盧淑儀、任達華、琦琦、鄺美雲等。原本坐在觀眾席的李克勤，突然被校長請上台，掀起全場掌聲不斷！</p><figure><img alt=\"譚詠麟。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183809923256320528076.jpeg/3Hy7jp43W52aGX0MyLu2sbnZ8fj2uCH1bZ9hi1ifYYs\"/><figcaption>譚詠麟。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚詠麟開騷。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183805716107264918642.jpeg/FoUSI_J0MNDhjett3W-vJzxiPGHMVuF9kZZDZqSWQ2Y\"/><figcaption>譚詠麟開騷。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183810506133504691247.jpeg/59WL9sJdCgJbzTDweSFC9xD1NfKc3O-Qma9mAqCvZgI\"/><figcaption>曾志偉。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李克勤、盧淑儀。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183812532113408864057.jpeg/LOjFc2rX3N4_np1F86d5ye92vVcVzM3ou8yFOIHMhTg\"/><figcaption>李克勤、盧淑儀。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李克勤、盧淑儀。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183812146368512376402.jpeg/CyhDTzzj4grHhm9ckopHGMp4KWhx3DE711VLpeJVS6U\"/><figcaption>李克勤、盧淑儀。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄺美雲。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183808568233984045618.jpeg/eqjbuRxoSq6kST6_fDdWliSYXypDqF3dyzTfPvI03z4\"/><figcaption>鄺美雲。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"任達華。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183814478532608491256.jpeg/qIl44TcdcvxeLoLyynqyj87MRnRhkrWKQmOGfXdjhn0\"/><figcaption>任達華。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><p>李克勤坦言：「我咁大個人第一次睇演唱會喊咗幾次。」他一上台即代表歌迷向校長致謝：「好想感謝譚詠麟先生，喺我哋個歲月裏面，畀咗我哋咁多好嘅歌！我坐喺度，志偉坐喺前面，係一路睇一路喊嘅，攬一下！」之後上前與校長擁抱，場面感人。校長回顧過往與李克勤組成「左麟右李」合作無間，所以感受特別深，李克勤亦表示回憶滿滿，期間更一度哽咽，最後兩人合唱經典金曲《朋友》，更掀起全場大合唱！</p><figure><img alt=\"李克勤突然被校長請上台。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175228471354593280469723.jpeg/6-3vvm9guYTHiRs2FEWlQrz_In9WdTwPsC7Q3Yku0N0\"/><figcaption>李克勤突然被校長請上台。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李克勤突然被校長請上台。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175228469123092480429167.jpeg/hovuMWmbreYYCgRW55LrhQ16sxohOGbYd4P08E6D9PA\"/><figcaption>李克勤突然被校長請上台。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李克勤坦言：「我咁大個人第一次睇演唱會喊咗幾次。」\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175228466551853056167842.jpeg/g2X9Inw_okIGWNZizmNxup6ThGLOptSDkLe066q3tOs\"/><figcaption>李克勤坦言：「我咁大個人第一次睇演唱會喊咗幾次。」</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩人擁抱，場面感人。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175228473590288384245916.jpeg/mfOa-_oBXhaNWBCIsYhytY_-cXMNuNdRRTJ9w3MyfcM\"/><figcaption>兩人擁抱，場面感人。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"合唱經典金曲《朋友》。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175228475767263232368402.jpeg/sJGvIANuFNiVMuDd1ucJRjaqVz0p4F7z6v36h9_9-oc\"/><figcaption>合唱經典金曲《朋友》。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"回憶滿滿。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175232713180057600042681.jpeg/wGvh6lZyztPqBing3MNBaJqc_U2PqPMkpCFe1J4hXtQ\"/><figcaption>回憶滿滿。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"回憶滿滿。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175232710776590336457902.jpeg/gc4tkVGYcVHiP2LFAIxq-YHYD5U9YBbkdFxbZU1cW2U\"/><figcaption>回憶滿滿。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"場面感人。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175232708415066112540167.jpeg/SEhxlxWO6e8QeuaI7mjjkJpD6NbMDWkxddTKmEPUypg\"/><figcaption>場面感人。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T16:20:06.972981+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":486,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}